24
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,000
Outer Suzaku Tomb

25
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,040
The Suzaku Tomb isn’t large,

26
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,680
it's divided into the inner and outer tomb.

27
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,110
A single sweep of Divine Sense

28
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,840
should help you find an altar.

29
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,520
Pass through it to enter the inner tomb.

30
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,360
There is a mountain at the center,

31
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,590
that is Ye Wuyou’s tomb.

32
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,230
Will you...

33
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:09,830
play with me ?

34
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,640
A monster ?

35
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,230
No.

36
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,430
It seems that the fire element of this place

37
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,830
manifested as a fire spirit.

38
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:23,960
As expected,

39
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,480
the scorched earth of this place

40
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,070
will endlessly heal this thing.

41
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,350
Will you...

42
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,190
play with me !?

43
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,200
Break !

44
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,560
This is

45
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:52,080
a soul strand ?

46
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,870
Every grain of this scorched earth

47
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,310
is actually a soul strand.

48
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,480
These soul strands are weak,

49
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,040
so they must be mortals.

50
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,710
Situ said the soul strands are in the inner tomb.

51
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,350
So why are they here ?

52
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,590
Could it be

53
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,230
that my soul strand is also one of these spirits ?

54
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:15,720
3 days later

55
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,270
3 days

56
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,470
and still no trace of the altar.

57
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:20,150
Senior !

58
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,510
Senior, save me !

59
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,550
If you help me

60
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,950
I can tell you

61
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,230
how to enter the inner tomb !

62
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,960
Junior's name is Murong Yun.

63
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,920
Thank you, seniors, for saving me.

64
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:50,360
Mo Yunhai
Early stage Soul Transformation

65
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,070
This old man is Mo Yunhai.

66
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,750
Fellow cultivator,

67
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,510
you're really skilled.

68
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,270
Junior,

69
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,910
you said that

70
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,790
you know how to enter the inner tomb.

71
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:00,230
Senior Mo,

72
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,010
when I arrived here

73
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:03,280
I saw Qian Feng

74
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:04,840
with several Forsaken Immortal Clan Warriors

75
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,280
enter the inner tomb.

76
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,240
If not for my low cultivation,

77
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,000
I'd have entered too.

78
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,880
I wonder where they entered.

79
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,800
At an altar.

80
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,040
But it's very remote

81
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,840
and the entrance has complex restrictions.

82
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:21,880
With all these strange things nearby,

83
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,360
I couldn't enter it alone.

84
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,230
If you can promise

85
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,110
to take me in with you,

86
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,480
then Junior

87
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,160
will lead you both there.

88
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,630
Fellow cultivator,

89
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,750
it should be manageable

90
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,790
if we join forces.

91
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,870
What do you think ?

92
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,160
This is the place !

93
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,870
Is this altar

94
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,750
the one you mentioned ?

95
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,440
That central spot

96
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,240
is the entrance.

97
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,150
Soul Search !

98
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,590
He's not lying.

99
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:17,880
However,

100
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:20,630
only one person can enter successfully.

101
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,600
I confirm it's here.

102
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,350
Fellow cultivator,

103
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,270
I'll go first.

104
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,440
You're quite clever.

105
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,680
How did you notice ?

106
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:44,230
I can tell you

107
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:46,830
but you'll have to answer my questions first.

108
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,470
Interesting...

109
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,240
But you answer me first !

110
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,950
Your clothes are ancient,

111
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,190
modern cultivators don't wear those.

112
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,880
Just this was enough ?

113
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,430
Of course, there are other reasons.

114
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,430
Now you tell me.

115
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,680
Who

116
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:01,950
are you ?

117
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,390
I'm formed from soul strands.

118
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,310
Why are you here ?

119
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,400
When this place shattered,

120
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:11,150
soul strands scattered everywhere.

121
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,110
Your soul strand might be nearby,

122
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,150
right over there.

123
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,840
What's your objective ?

124
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,640
I have no particular purpose.

125
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,720
I just don't want people to succeed.

126
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,800
Your turn now.

127
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,280
What gave me out ?

128
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,720
The spiritual energy in those lightning bolts

129
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,670
was enough to kill you instantly

130
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,790
but they just kept following you.

131
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,720
Your self-centered act was too fake.

132
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,280
Tell me,

133
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,750
where is the real altar ?

134
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:39,390
You'll never know !

135
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,240
Seal !

136
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:59,200
Even if you kill these soul strands,

137
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,960
it's people of planet Suzaku that will die.

138
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,190
But I

139
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:05,510
can absorb new soul strands to revive.

140
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,750
You can't kill me !

141
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:15,830
I won't kill you,

142
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,390
but I will seal you.

143
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:21,630
You will be cut off from the outside.

144
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:25,030
When your host's lifespan ends,

145
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,390
you

146
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,670
will also die.

147
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,800
I'll tell you where the altar is !

148
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:32,590
Now let me out !

149
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,190
Speak.

150
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,200
East of here

151
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,400
in a valley surrounded by 9 peaks.

152
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,830
The mist there is white instead of black.

153
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,640
The altar is at the bottom.

154
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,390
You liar !

155
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,630
As more cultivators

156
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:01,950
discovered the secret of the soul strands,

157
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:05,470
they started slaughtering them repeatedly,

158
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:08,160
waiting for their own soul strand to appear.

159
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:11,430
This cruel method was sacrificing the lives of others

160
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:13,630
to find their own soul strand.

161
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:16,830
This made the situation in the Suzaku Tomb

162
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,670
even more chaotic.

163
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,600
It should have recovered by now,

164
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,160
lure it out again.

165
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:47,200
Still no sign of my soul strand !

166
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:51,840
Explode !

167
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,400
He...

168
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,550
He's dead...

169
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,120
His soul strand was destroyed.

170
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:08,630
Again !

171
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,800
We're waiting here for my soul strand.

172
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,160
If it doesn't appear,

173
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,360
then each time it reforms

174
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,190
we kill the spirit.

175
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:23,200
Outer Suzaku Tomb Altar

176
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,550
Long time no see,

177
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:30,790
Wang Lin...

178
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:32,590
Scram !

179
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:40,320
You really are Early stage Soul Transformation...

180
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,270
Your progress is astonishing.

181
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,800
Zhuque Zi's death is imminent.

182
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,200
Our battle

183
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,480
is unnecessary.

184
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:49,120
I don't just fight you

185
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:51,030
because my master told me to.

186
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:54,640
It's for your Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain.

187
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:55,760
Am I right ?

188
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,230
I use illusions

189
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,030
to experience mortal emotions

190
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,750
and cultivate ruthlessness.

191
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,520
While you

192
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,430
started with emotions

193
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,040
to comprehend Life and Death.

194
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,070
By becoming mortal

195
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:09,240
you understood the Dao of Life and Death !

196
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:10,510
You and I

197
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,390
are the same.

198
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,620
I don't have time for this

199
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,600
but Liu Mei is Middle stage Soul Transformation

200
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,080
so I can't end this quickly...

201
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:22,070
I must get my soul strand as fast as possible.

202
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:25,400
If you dare to use the Billion-Soul Flag,

203
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,840
I'll just destroy this altar.

204
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,030
It will take days to reform

205
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,640
and you can't wait that long...

206
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,230
What do you really want ?

207
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:43,510
I just need one last illusion to complete my domain

208
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,510
and reach Late stage Soul Transformation.

209
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,520
I will borrow your Dao

210
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:50,270
to complete my Thousand Illusions.

211
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:52,190
What do you think ?

212
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,870
Just one illusion ?

213
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:57,670
I'll show you,

214
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,830
just don't regret it later.

215
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,550
My Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain

216
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:09,110
is like a peacock's thousand feathers.

217
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,470
Each feather

218
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:11,870
is an illusion.

219
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,190
Each illusion

220
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,830
is one of my avatar's lifetimes.

221
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,310
Now that only the last one remains

222
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:18,840
You...

223
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:21,070
will become my cauldron !

224
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:23,510
Red Butterfly's Ruthless Domain

225
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:25,190
required severing love.

226
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,880
But this woman is so cold-hearted

227
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:29,360
that she has no love to sever.

228
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,310
Her domain

229
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:33,190
is far above Red Butterfly's.

230
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,630
The beauty of this world

231
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,870
resides in its ruthlessness.

232
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,040
The beauty of a rainbow

233
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:43,870
is admired by millions

234
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,390
but cannot be captured.

235
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:49,070
Like the tail of a peacock,

236
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,360
even if it's beautiful,

237
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,110
it can rarely be seen.

238
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:54,830
Ruthless...

239
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:57,230
I thought that your domain

240
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,470
was aligned with the law of the heavens.

241
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:03,080
Our paths diverge but we share the same ruthlessness.

242
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:07,040
I never expected your domain to have such a glaring flaw.

243
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,880
It makes devouring your domain easy.

244
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:12,390
It's almost a bit disappointing.

245
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,000
Devour !

246
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:19,360
Who cares about the law of the heavens ?

247
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,920
Between heaven and earth,

248
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:22,710
what must die will die

249
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:26,310
even if the law of the heavens allow the opposite.

250
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,040
I don't agree with that.

251
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:31,030
Your last illusion

252
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:32,950
will not be my domain.

253
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:36,110
Life and Death Reincarnation cycle !

254
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:43,720
I really like this physical body

255
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,870
that you have found for me.

256
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:50,600
Brother Wang,

257
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:53,360
this is how much I understood of Liu Mei's domain.

258
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,390
She only needs one last illusion

259
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,670
to reach a thousand.

260
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,750
Brother Wang, you must be careful.

261
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:02,960
If Liu Mei really wants to devour my domain,

262
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:05,640
then I'm no match for her with my cultivation.

263
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,150
There is only one way

264
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,160
to break her Dao Heart.

265
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,910
Little brother,

266
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,760
you finally remembered me.

267
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:18,270
I think you need a new body.

268
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:20,440
I'll help you get one

269
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:22,110
and give you back your freedom.

270
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:25,760
Lust is the perfect counter to Liu Mei's Ruthlessness.

271
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,670
Once Mei Ji takes over,

272
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:29,910
Liu Mei will lose her mind

273
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:32,310
and become Mei Ji's puppet.

274
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,350
Wang Lin...

275
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,390
you bastard !

276
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:39,030
If you hadn't insisted on devouring my domain,

277
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:42,520
I wouldn't have had the chance to let Mei Ji possess you.

278
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,280
You brought

279
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:46,030
all this upon yourself !

280
00:13:46,750 --> 00:13:47,510
Seal !

281
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,830
The Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain

282
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,310
will be stained by lust

283
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,520
breaking its ruthlessness.

284
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,880
Formation,

285
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:58,680
activate !

286
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,350
Little sister,

287
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:09,600
will you obediently give me your physical body ?

288
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:20,960
What's wrong ?

289
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:23,180
A part of my domain

290
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:24,920
is about to possess a body.

291
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:26,840
Is that your old

292
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:28,070
Lust Domain ?

293
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,510
If the possession succeeds

294
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:32,830
she will take a part of my power.

295
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:34,560
I can't allow this.

296
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:37,350
I need to wipe her out today.

297
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:47,040
How can there be a force interrupting the possession !?

298
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:49,670
She wants to get rid of me !

299
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,070
Activate !

300
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:01,560
Since neither can take over the body

301
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:03,190
then we will merge !

302
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:45,310
I didn't expect

303
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:48,470
that my final illusion

304
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,630
would be one of lust.

305
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:52,670
Wang Lin,

306
00:15:53,350 --> 00:15:55,190
you have ruined my Dao Heart

307
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:58,560
by transforming my domain into the Thousand Illusions Lust Domain !

308
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,440
This grudge between us

309
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:02,110
is irreconcilable !

310
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:11,400
Mountain River
Suzaku Tomb

311
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:15,910
According to Situ,

312
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:19,200
there should be a mountain in the center of the inner tomb.

313
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:21,120
The crystal should be there.

314
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,480
I think that in order to find the center,

315
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,870
I need to cross this ravine.

316
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,240
The soul strands here

317
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:29,630
are getting stronger.

318
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,440
I'd rather not provoke them.

319
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:41,640
Shit !

320
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,080
The tomb's collapse is accelerating !

321
00:16:55,660 --> 00:19:31,830
The scene was already cryptic in the novel, it's even more confusing in the donghua. It will get explained later anyways. Feel free to read what happened in the novel and try to read between the lines:

Her domain was currently far above Wang Lin’s Life and Death Domain, which was only at the Early stage of Soul Transformation, so he obviously couldn’t resist it.
The pink mist that covered everything within tens of thousands of kilometers was now slowly condensing back toward the valley.
This process lasted for two days. All of the pink mist outside of the valley had come back, but the valley itself was still covered in pink mist. From inside the mist, the painful cries of a woman could be heard, but that voice was also filled with pleasure. The voice was like the song of a fairy that would make anyone’s heart pound and blood surge.
After an unknown amount of time, the pink mist gradually faded, revealing a woman lying on the side of the altar. Clarity slowly returned to her eyes.
[...]
“I can’t believe that the last illusion of the Thousand Illusion Ruthless Domain is this illusion. The moment this illusion appears, the domain changes to the Thousand Illusion Lust Domain. All of this is like an illusion, yet it is so real. I never thought that my Thousand Illusion Ruthless Domain’s last illusion would be obtained like this… Master wanted me to leave my mark on Wang Lin’s dao heart, but he never would have thought that my last illusion would contain his aura…”
[...]
Wang Lin’s body appeared in a wasteland in the inner section of the Suzaku Tomb. After he appeared, he looked into the sky with a very complex expression.
While being surrounded by the pink mist, he felt like he was in a dream. When the pink mist dissipated, he saw a woman below him. At that moment, his heart felt pain for her.

322
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:16,080
To let go of the consequences of my actions

323
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:17,800
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

324
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:19,740
like scattered ink.

325
00:17:20,620 --> 00:17:27,220
As destiny falls

326
00:17:23,460 --> 00:17:27,220
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

327
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:34,820
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

328
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:34,820
wither and melt into rivers.

329
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:42,380
Who can deceive

330
00:17:38,020 --> 00:17:42,380
the law of the heavens ?

331
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:45,700
Countless generations

332
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:45,700
have tried before me.

333
00:17:45,990 --> 00:17:49,420
But how could I not catch my dreams

334
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:49,420
within my warm fingers ?

335
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:53,500
You're at my side when I'm alone

336
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:56,820
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

337
00:17:57,580 --> 00:18:00,780
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

338
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:04,980
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

339
00:18:02,980 --> 00:18:04,980
in the streets.

340
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:09,940
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

341
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:09,940
Can I break the rules ?

342
00:18:09,950 --> 00:18:12,660
To run towards you !

343
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:15,980
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

344
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:20,620
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

345
00:18:20,620 --> 00:18:24,020
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

346
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:28,700
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

347
00:18:29,150 --> 00:18:34,380
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

348
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:38,300
If your soul is willing to wander,

349
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:42,940
can I still take your hands

350
00:18:39,980 --> 00:18:42,940
and hold them tight ?

351
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:46,020
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

352
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:50,900
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

353
00:18:50,910 --> 00:18:54,180
I dream of destroying

354
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:58,900
the shackles of our fate.

355
00:18:58,900 --> 00:19:02,860
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

356
00:19:02,860 --> 00:19:05,660
You're the hardest to let go of.

357
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:09,540
I want to be with you again

358
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:12,900
so I can look in your eyes.

359
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:18,140
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
